    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d230">

                <pb facs="0352" n="305" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v03mSupp/pg305"/>

                <head>230. Telegram 777 to Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d230-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1955-09-23">September 23, 1955, 6:34
                            p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d230-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d230-1"/>
                <p>777. For Johnson.</p>
                <p>Chinese departures. In future telegrams this subject code word FEDEP rpt FEDEP
                    will mean cumulative total as of given date of confirmed departures Chinese
                    nationals destined Far East since July 11. <pb facs="0353" n="306"
                        type="typeset" xml:id="pg306"/> Code word ALDEP rpt ALDEP will refer total
                    for all destinations. Latter figure to continue FYI at your discretion.</p>
                <p>As of September 23, FEDEP 378. ALDEP 721.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Dulles</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
